{"kind":"Article","sha256":"32ba248e3bc359ce3f0b11162d95fb1f8b8115971eeeccb0f1155b69900793dc","slug":"monstrous","location":"/origins/physicality/monstrous.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Monstrous","github":"https://github.com/SkillWeaverNexus/skillweavernexus.github.io","keywords":[],"thumbnail":"/build/monstrous-copy-2492f3da7052cd1a6a95148c98b1e8c3.png","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"monstrous.md","url":"/build/monstrous-31f4c767d731c538a7842123267c1a1f.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/build/monstrous-copy-2492f3da7052cd1a6a95148c98b1e8c3.png","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"vjX9l9GWf5","urlSource":"../../img/origins/monstrous-copy.png"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You have a lineage leading to (or some sort of event-triggered) monstrous capabilities. Choose one of the following (or work with your GM to make a new one):","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"nrNWusCpSR"}],"key":"OlHmouhmu6"},{"type":"details","open":true,"children":[{"type":"summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vampiric","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"L1B1MajW4U"}],"key":"w28Ha136f5"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You have some level of vampirism. You gain a bite (melee) attack which costs 2 stamina, uses your personality die [13], and deals damage equal to your player level and inflicts the bleeding condition using a d4. You gain the spell Suggest for free, so long as you have the Magic Initiate ability. Your GM may impose sunlight related debuffs.","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"xVZOqMJet1"}],"key":"iDBIRguKme"}],"key":"pIwAFz7r6H"},{"type":"details","open":true,"children":[{"type":"summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Were-creature","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"uNyQ5FGH1Z"}],"key":"q0haJhqPoW"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You have some level of lycanthropy. You gain a claw (melee) attack which which costs 2 stamina, uses your Physicality die [13] and deals damage equal to your player level, inflicting the bleeding condition using a d4. Under a full moon or GM-defined natural condition, your damage is doubled and bleed dice moves up 1.","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"sbOe1RTKRu"}],"key":"eFFyuyobKB"}],"key":"xisIHiK7og"},{"type":"details","open":true,"children":[{"type":"summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Zombie","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"qzhR40sRcd"}],"key":"yroBYy3nDo"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You are at least partially undead. You gain a claw attack which uses your Healing die [13], costs 2 stamina, and deals damage equal to your player level and inflicts the poisoned condition using a d4. You can survive for up to 10 minutes without air to breathe.","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"bmpRjFQE1t"}],"key":"RJoPSzUxBE"}],"key":"OA4meUI9hg"},{"type":"details","open":true,"children":[{"type":"summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Faerie","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"Yn5oGZRAt9"}],"key":"ENjca4wg8j"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You are touched by Fae magic or hail from a fae lineage. You gain a psychic sliver (range 30 ft) attack which costs 2 stamina, uses your Reasoning die [13], and deals damage equal to your player level, inflicting the charmed condition using a d4. You have access to the Minor Invisibility spell, so long as you have the Magic Initiate ability.","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"key":"Z10oSXkit2"}],"key":"JUmvf2DHwH"}],"key":"IECmHdDl54"},{"type":"details","open":true,"children":[{"type":"summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dragonite","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":28,"column":1}},"key":"QyfEjtCTAp"}],"key":"JrAEaQ2Asl"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1},"end":{"line":30,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You have lineage touched by dragons or a similar creature. You gain a fire breath (range, 15 ft) ability which costs 2 stamina, deals damage equal to your player level and inflicts the burning condition using a d4. You gain access to the Minor Shapeshift spell for free, so long as you have the Magic Initiate ability.","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1},"end":{"line":30,"column":1}},"key":"vDx3y0VHlA"}],"key":"tPyQPic3xK"}],"key":"izyKzH1EvY"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Increased Potency","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"key":"rd8SXU5jUT"}],"identifier":"increased-potency","label":"Increased Potency","html_id":"increased-potency","implicit":true,"key":"uIoDASTJIY"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1},"end":{"line":34,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"If your player level reaches 5, your condition die increases from d4 to d6. At level 10, it increases from d6 to d8.","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1},"end":{"line":34,"column":1}},"key":"YfW5iyzddb"}],"key":"giw16Rx0RJ"},{"type":"admonition","kind":"tip","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","ch